!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = Samples were formalin fixed for 3 days prior to embedding in paraffin and sectioning.
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = Rapid autopsy was performed for samples collection.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA extraction from FFPE slides was done using the FormaPure Total nucleic acid extraction kit (C16675, Beckman Coulter) according to manufacturer instructions. Three 5 um thin tissue sections from areas devoid of acute inflammation were used per sample
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = The Smarter Stranded Total RNA-Seq kit v2 (634413, Illumina) was used with 10 ng RNA input, according to the manufacturer instructions to generate libraries.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Dual-indexed pooled libraries were sequenced on the Illumina NextSeq 500 platform using a 150 cycles kit with paired end read mode.
!Sample_data_processing = Reads aligned to HG38
!Sample_data_processing = Deduplicated BAM files used with HTSeq-Count to create count tables
